Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:54.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's my doll !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me play with it for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:57.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try to catch me then !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:00.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you, stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who allowed you to come over here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.49,0:02:05.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't disturb the Celestial's cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:06.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial hasn't shown himself for 3 months...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refining a Soul Flag is relatively easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:22.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,That makes it suitable for the tribe members to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even without spiritual energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,if they cultivate these techniques with demonic energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,we might get unexpected results.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:32.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Soul Flag made from redwood and beast hide
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.41,0:02:38.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,is way weaker than a true Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,but is simple to craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:44.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tribe members will be able to protect themselves with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:51.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how long someone refines the souls they capture
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:54.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the modified Soul Refining spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:56.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to control them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a single thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,The stronger the tribe becomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more Soul Flags I will control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can also use this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,to refill the Billion-Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Billion-Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be more confident
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,in obtaining an Ancient Demon Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:26.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:29.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,to impart this technique to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,All tribe members
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:34.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,must practice this technique from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:37.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.89,0:03:40.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if Junior has heard of these objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:43.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Put it on your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Clear your mind and comprehend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:52.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's nothing at all ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:56.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blocked meridians
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:58.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and poor talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder he can't sense it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:09.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Concentrate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:10.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,and endure the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior can see it now !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will find inside the method to craft a Soul Flag and the Soul Refining spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:34.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must memorize them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:35.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must teach them to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:40.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouyang Hua
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:43.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,will never forget Celestial's kindness !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:44.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick, quick, quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:47.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over here, over here !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:22.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rank 3 Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:23.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,This demonic energy is pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:46.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't have enough of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,just the equivalent of a Foundation Establishment cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:57.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Patriarch,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen was the first to successfully refine a Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:02.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Soul Flag looks so impressive !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Thirteen is amazing !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Thirteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:08.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if you refined the Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still need to refine souls and seal them inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:16.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mustn't be arrogant nor impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:21.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's all help Thirteen hunt beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,to help him extract their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who said I don't have souls ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Watch closely !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,So powerful !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wh...What kind of demon beast is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Winged Mane Lion !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you subdue
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,such a powerful demon beast ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I went hunting outside the valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I encountered this beast that had just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I silently recited the mantra taught by the Celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,and actually managed to extract its soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and seal it inside this Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Withdraw !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Return !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:45.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:07.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Celestial for saving my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:08.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Soul Refining spell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:10.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,has no shortcuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:13.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you sealed this beast by chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:15.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,if your cultivation is too low,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will suffer a backlash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,This child is actually pretty talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:28.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,With just this little guidance, he seems to have understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,He could achieve great things
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:31.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,if he matures a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:38.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:40.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 27 members in the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:44.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Currently, besides me and Thirteen who have primary soul in our Soul Flags,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,most of the others are still diligently practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:54.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,now that outsiders have entered our land,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:59.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,a new round of tribe wars
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,to plunder resources
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:03.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,is about to begin, as it did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our days ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,are going to be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:17.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rather than waiting to be attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:18.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should strike first !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:23.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since we have no way to escape these conflicts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't we strengthen ourselves as quickly as possible ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:27.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to mobilize the tribe members
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:32.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,to invade an underground cave 1000 li away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's inhabited by another tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,with several dozen members.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Refining spell I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,grants you the freedom to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.34,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1707,433)\fad(300,000)}Cave Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:49.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:54.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:55.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you won't be killed !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep up !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:18.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:19.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The memory-wiping soup
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,makes them forget their past
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be reborn as a new tribe member.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this soup is useless on cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's miraculous on the natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:33.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,the tribe expands
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,and more people can practice the Soul Refining spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,This battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to the Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to the Celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:48.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:50.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the Demon Spirit Crystal Junior found in the other tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,I offer it to you, Celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Offering a Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:00.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,counts as an achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the mantra for the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Study it well
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,and don't teach it to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen will repay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial's kindness with his life !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen is favored by the Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:14.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,the future surely belongs to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our small tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,will eventually live in prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,These old bones of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,are glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:33.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look, they're leaving !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen and the others are so impressive !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:37.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever Brother Thirteen goes out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,we always have meat on our plates in the evening !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:43.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,this was the right move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,488)\fad(1000,1000)}3 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen's squad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,should have returned 2 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Thirteen !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:13.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:17.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:26.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,His meridians are shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,his cultivation is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:36.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were ambushed by a large tribe named the Tianshui Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of my squad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:46.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The white-robed elder leading them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.09,0:12:50.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,took my Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and planted a demon inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:56.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,He said if you want the Soul Flag back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must go to the Tianshui Tribe to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:01.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take him to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:14.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:16.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Tianshui Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:19.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the most powerful tribe outside Ancient Demon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:22.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are entrenched within an ancient formation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:26.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,that was unshaken for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a living challenge letter the Tianshui Tribe sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:36.66,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(355,431)}Tianshui Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:38.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Coming up !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make way, make way !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:43.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Coveting his spells is one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you crippled his cultivation too ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:47.10,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1537,566)\fad(300,000)}Xie Hao\NTianshui Tribe Leader\NRank 1000 demonic energy\N(Nascent Soul)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:48.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:50.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a bit excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:52.50,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1525,562)}Zeng Wei\NTianshui Tribe member\NRank 10 000 demonic energy\N(Soul Formation)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am under the Left Wing General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could killing a few savages
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.09,0:13:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,be called excessive ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technique that kid had was pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it's incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the one behind him doesn't dare to show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:10.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will go to that small tribe tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and retrieve the full technique myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's always a higher mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:19.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is still too risky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:21.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patriarch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:23.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've grown senile !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:26.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that person was truly that skilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:29.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,why wouldn't they join the army of Ancient Demon City ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:33.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could they possibly dwell in a small tribe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:38.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover, our Tianshui Tribe has lasted thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we really provoked someone powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:42.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,we still have the ancient formation to guard us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:44.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're completely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:57.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one who issued the challenge letter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:14:59.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,can come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:03.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,An outsider !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Transformation cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:09.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was this old man who took those little flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you wish to make me pay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,then break the formation and come in !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Tianshui Tribe has lasted for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:04.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you have heaven-defying abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:05.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,this formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't something you can break !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:12.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,I advise you to scram immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:15.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,and stop making a fool of yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:16.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:20.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,can actually absorb attacks to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,it naturally became indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wh..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:44.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rise !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:49.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rise !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.69,0:17:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look who you've provoked !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:02.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,A madman...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:03.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's a madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Breaking the formation will take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,But refining you along with the formation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:17.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,is pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:30.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:31.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:48.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you insist on not coming out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:51.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will refine you for 7 days and 7 nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.81,0:17:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,By then, your Tianshui Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:55.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have suffered the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pray to Celestial's divine might !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:08.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't implicate the entire tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:13.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the trouble you created !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was the one who issued the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you dare fight me one-on-one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:24.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't involve the innocents !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:26.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:35.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouyang Hua,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have new tribe members.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tribe is growing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:02.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to Celestial's divine might !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:06.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We humbly request Celestial to bestow a new name upon our tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,to grant us a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,has one last request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tribe shall be named...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:24.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Soul Refining Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:29.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The clouds and the mist cannot hide a thousand mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:35.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}This wish has remained unchanged for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:39.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The Dao can be condensed into a single thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:46.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The past flashes before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:46.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}as I turn around to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:52.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Resolutely carrying the torch forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:57.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even though the cycle of reincarnation is endless,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:20:02.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I have no regrets in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:08.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Only when facing death
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}does one realize they have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:14.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I will fulfill your wish,\NI will rush forward through dust and smoke to chase the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:19.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even if the road is difficult,\NI will give it my heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:25.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Behind you, countless clear eyes\Nlook at the world you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:31.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}You soul will not die,\Nit will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:53.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I hold in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:53.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}your wish to bring back your past glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:58.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}There will always be someone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:58.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}to see the world you protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:04.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even if it takes countless lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:09.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Seeing mountains and rivers is like meeting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:14.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Let me carry on all the wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:19.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}that you couldn't fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:55.94,Promise,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,727)\fad(1000,1000)}Fulfilling your wish
